# Select the first original prospector code with the ship's real mouse UI.
COMMAND restore
TYPE HANGARFULL
KEY enter
ASSERT_LOCATION 139 d3
LABEL ship_restored
COMMAND sit
TYPE C
MOUSE_CLICK 160 114
TYPE G
WAIT_MS 70000
ASSERT_LOCATION 113 d3
LABEL first_mission_complete
COMMAND save
TYPE MISSIONFULL1
KEY enter
